# Unit tests

Follow the Practical Test Pyramid / GitLab “small tests”: **fast, isolated, majority of the suite**.

## What belongs here

- Pure functions and validators (`schemas`, CAG examples module, prompt builders)
- Branching and error messages without HTTP or network
- Edge cases: empty input, min length, missing files, bad provider config

## Rules

- **No I/O**: no real HTTP, DB, disk writes outside fixtures, no real LLM API calls
- Replace externals with fakes/mocks/stubs; keep doubles close to real contracts
- One behavior per test; name: `test_<unit>_<condition>_<expected>`
- Must run in milliseconds and be fully deterministic (no time/network flakes)
- Arrange–Act–Assert; assert on observable outputs, not private internals unless necessary

## Example targets in this repo

- `EstimationRequest` min length / strip validation
- `ESTIMATION_EXAMPLES` has ≥2 entries with `meeting_summary` + `estimation`
- `load_cag_examples_markdown` markers
- `app.services.prompts.build_system_prompt` includes CAG delimiters
- `Settings.validate_provider_and_model` missing API key

## Do not

- Start FastAPI/`TestClient` here (that is integration)
- Sleep, retry loops, or hit `localhost`
